{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay02_title", "source_sha256": "30b8044fd605ecd98e4a7e295c3d5055586a3fa659b41b4ab06e8250946de207", "ja": "やよいとおでかけ2", "zh": "和弥生出门2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5b9a6606f4c753fe6cdfe31c72b7791fb0c2df1552ab49c0da90a2b82d9c9377", "ja": "やよいとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和弥生一起外出的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "77d8f29e9506ec5b27f47550f5288e684b3b9888a89c361aa77ec7f9e2061af2", "ja": "（ツアーの休日、やよいと一緒に牧場に来た。\n色んな動物がいっぱいで、面白いな！）", "zh": "（巡演的休息日，和弥生一起来了牧场。这里有好多各种各样的动物，真有意思啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay02_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "42a43d6e3f6b8b84a60c1617595f36002da0f777886708674b6a343a87411c1d", "ja": "{$P$}、お馬さんがいますよ！\nすっごいですー！　あ！　あっちには牛さんも……！", "zh": "{$P$}，那里有马哦！\n好厉害——！啊！那边还有奶牛……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f89e314acbf46b615fac1a4e01b09658969c01021a7688fec76487b4eda67521", "ja": "（やよい、楽しそうにしてくれて良かった。最近は\n忙しかったから、リフレッシュできてるといいけど）", "zh": "（弥生玩得这么开心，真是太好了。她最近一直很忙，希望这次能好好放松一下吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "94005934a6f5ab5032c04b1dd2dafce96a82762818ca27840daf7a37c324c906", "ja": "やよい、あっちにソフトクリームが売ってるぞ。\n食べないか？", "zh": "弥生，那边有卖冰淇淋哦。\n要吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay02_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "0db7bf989698eeb3c104e957d95d2150feb6020bbcdf73e61cfaa7399c8640b7", "ja": "わあ！　牧場のソフトクリーム、食べてみたいです！\nあっ。でも、えっと……。", "zh": "哇！我想尝尝牧场的冰激凌！\n啊，不过，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay02_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "aa5e1bfb4bbb9d9855ab8f0c8f36af7a931eca48ad98925beefcafbb0d29a369", "ja": "私、今月はちょっと、お小遣いを使いすぎちゃって。\n帰りは、家族やみんなに、お土産も買いたいし……。", "zh": "我这个月零花钱花得有点多了。\n回去的时候，还想给家人和大家买伴手礼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "68ce827a0bd894efda6260a02f9722d2e136f57f47cd9249dc533cdad9149dfe", "ja": "そうだったのか。でも、心配しなくて大丈夫だよ。\n今日のソフトクリーム代は、経費で落とせるから。", "zh": "原来是这样。不过，不用担心。\n今天的冰淇淋费用可以算作开销报销。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay02_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "ad821cfbfda83d90c1ff4795d00c82d500cddb2b2ec207d9a3f817980c12eb73", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "18e6945245c1ae32223e52dabded50efbcb36267536d792f16ea245f2f776415", "ja": "「これで皆にご馳走してくれたまえ」って、社長が\nくれたんだ。だからやよいも、遠慮しなくていいぞ！", "zh": "社长跟我说“拿去请大家吃顿好的吧”，就把钱\n给我了。所以弥生也不用客气哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_005yay02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_005yay02_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "d440c29c7f964eff0b69784022849bba87e8bae4924b3f648f91acf814bcfded", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとうございます！\n社長にも、あとでお礼を言わなくちゃ！　えへへっ。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢您！\n之后也得向社长道谢才行！嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
